{"Title":"An Act relative to adoptions","BillNumber":"S3009","DocketNumber":null,"GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"J19","Name":"Joint Committee on the Judiciary","Type":2,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J19","ResponseDate":"2024-12-27T10:05:03.763"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"CSC0","Name":"Cynthia Stone Creem","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/CSC0","ResponseDate":"2024-05-14T16:35:31.82"},{"Id":"L_S1","Name":"Lindsay N. Sabadosa","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/L_S1","ResponseDate":"2024-05-14T16:45:06.7366667"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/S3009/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"Senate, December 30, 2024 -- The committee on The Judiciary, to whom was referred the petitions (accompanied by bill, Senate, No. 2835) (subject to Joint Rule 12) of Cynthia Stone Creem for legislation relative to adoptions outside of the Commonwealth; and (accompanied by bill, House Bill, No. 4709) (subject to Joint Rule 12) of Lindsay N. Sabadosa relative to adoptions outside of the Commonwealth, report the accompanying bill (Senate, No. 3009).\r\n","DocumentText":"\tSection 2 of chapter 210 of the General Laws, as appearing in the 2022 Official Edition, is hereby amended by striking out, in line 49, the words “state or the country where it was executed” and inserting in place thereof the following words:- commonwealth or the laws of the place where it was executed.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Redraft","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J19","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J19"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}